# Local secrets for `npm run dev`. Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored).
# Production secrets go through `wrangler secret put <NAME>`, never the repo.
# Add names here as tickets introduce them.

# Keep a .dev.vars file even if it's empty: without one, wrangler falls back to .env
# and would expose every .env/.env.local variable to the Worker (and to `wrangler types`).

# STM-5: Resend API key for magic-link emails. Leave unset locally: on localhost the
# link is printed to the wrangler dev console instead of being emailed.
# Production: npx wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
# RESEND_API_KEY=
